    "summary": "<h2>2026.6.34</h2>\n<h3>Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Safer browser and network boundaries:</strong> sandboxed browser routes, trusted DNS targets, custom browser origins, and loopback provider endpoints now reject unsafe access paths. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4772463359\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/97958\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/97958/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/97958\">#97958</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4035830934\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/38290\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/38290/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/38290\">#38290</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4849011363\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/103075\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/103075/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/103075\">#103075</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4918253531\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/110693\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/110693/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/110693\">#110693</a>) Thanks <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/eleqtrizit/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/eleqtrizit\">@eleqtrizit</a>, <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/brunowowk/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/brunowowk\">@brunowowk</a>, <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/mosidevv/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/mosidevv\">@mosidevv</a>, <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/pgondhi987/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/pgondhi987\">@pgondhi987</a>, and <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/lsr911/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/lsr911\">@lsr911</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>More resilient agent and provider runs:</strong> retained session writes, provider fallbacks, stream progress handling, and stdio failures now recover without silently ending active work. (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4725862718\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/96100\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/96100/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/96100\">#96100</a>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4756019481\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/97128\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openclaw/openclaw/pull/97128/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/97128\">#97128</a>, <a cla